# Governance

## Purpose

Define and enforce governance policies across the SelOps operational platform.

## Guidelines

- Changes to production configuration require peer review and approval.
- Compliance checkpoints are integrated into the CI pipeline, not deferred to release.
- Audit trails are immutable and cover all privileged operations.

